<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26401" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lĕvātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id.. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A lifting up, raising, elevating</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">onerum levationes facere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					10, 8</span></i>
			; a metrical t. t. = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρσις</span>,
				<i><span class="en">Aug. Mas. II.
			18</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>An alleviation, mitigation, relief</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alicui esse levationi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 6, 4, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ea, quae levationem habeant aegritudinum,</span>”
				<i>may produce an alleviation, may alleviate</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 1, 49, 119</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">levationem invenire acerbissimis doloribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5, 41, 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">doloris at officii debiti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Att. 12, 23, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A diminishing</i> (rare but class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitiorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 4, 24, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">periculi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 130 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
